# 108,000 Lennard-Jones atoms: a liquid melted from an fcc crystal.
# Based on the LAMMPS "in.lj" benchmark. Too many atoms for sphere
# geometry; use View > Draw atoms as > Billboards to see all of them.
#/atom 1 1.6 #6EC6FF

units lj
atom_style atomic

lattice fcc 0.8442
region box block 0 30 0 30 0 30
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0

velocity all create 1.44 87287 loop geom

pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5

neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 5 check yes

fix 1 all nve

thermo 100
run 100000
